---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

const title = "Refunds";
const description =
  "The current status of ListBulkly billing and the refund terms that will apply before any payment is taken.";
---

<LegalLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <p>
    <strong>Draft.</strong> This page exists so the payment terms are stated before
    they can ever be charged. No payment is taken today, and the contact address is
    already real.
  </p>

  <h2>The honest status</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Free plan: 5 listings a month, no card, no charge ever.</li>
    <li>Paid plans (Starter $10 / Pro $20 / Business $30 a month) are billed monthly through Razorpay, in your currency at the day's exchange rate.</li>
    <li>On deployments where billing is not yet live, no payment can be taken and prices are estimates, not an offer.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A plan runs for the 31 days you paid for. Because the full workflow is usable free, a started month is generally non-refundable; we refund in full when a payment was duplicated or made in error, and when a technical fault on our side stopped you creating listings for most of the month.</li>
    <li>Request one by email: <a href="mailto:listbulkly@gmail.com">listbulkly@gmail.com</a> with "billing" in the subject. We answer with the outcome and, for approved refunds, process it back through Razorpay to the original payment method.</li>
    <li>Failed, stuck or duplicate payments are corrected at source: the plan is granted only after a verified, captured payment, and a webhook backstop grants it if your browser closed before the confirmation came back.</li>
    <li>Cancelling stops the next renewal; the plan you paid for keeps working until its month ends.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Provider charges are separate</h2>
  <p>
    Printify, Etsy, your AI provider and Razorpay bill you directly for what you use
    on their platforms. ListBulkly cannot refund those charges; their own policies
    apply. Cancelling a ListBulkly plan would not cancel a Printify subscription.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Billing questions: <a href="mailto:listbulkly@gmail.com">listbulkly@gmail.com</a>
    with "billing" in the subject. The full contact details are on the
    <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
